6e:T154b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"When was Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) released?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) was released on September 1, 2026."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who created Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) was created by Anthropic."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How intelligent is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) scores 53 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index, placing it well above average among other models in a similar price tier (median: 27)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How fast is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) generates output at 71.6 tokens per second (based on Anthropic's API), which is below average compared to other models in a similar price tier (median: 81.3 t/s)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the latency of Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) has a time to first token (TTFT) of 261.97s (based on Anthropic's API), which is at the higher end compared to other models in a similar price tier (median: 5.87s)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) costs $10.00 per 1M input tokens (at the higher end, median: $2.00) and $50.00 per 1M output tokens (at the higher end, median: $10.00), based on Anthropic's API."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) API pricing?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) costs $10.00 per 1M input tokens and $50.00 per 1M output tokens (based on Anthropic's API). For a blended rate (7:2:1 cache hit/input/output ratio), this is $7.17 per 1M tokens. Pricing may vary by provider."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How verbose is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"When evaluated on the Intelligence Index, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) generated 190M output tokens, which is at the higher end compared to other models in a similar price tier (median: 85M)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) a reasoning model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is a reasoning model. It uses extended thinking or chain-of-thought reasoning to work through complex problems before providing an answer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What input modalities does Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) supports text and image input."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What output modalities does Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) supports text output."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) process images?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) supports image input and can analyze, describe, and answer questions about images."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) multimodal?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is multimodal. It can process text and image input and generate text output."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the context window of Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) has a context window of 1.0M tokens. This determines how much text and conversation history the model can process in a single request."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) open source?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is proprietary. The model weights are not publicly available."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How many parameters does Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is a proprietary model and Anthropic has not disclosed the model size or parameter count."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) perform on benchmarks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) achieves a score of 53 on the Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index. This composite benchmark evaluates models across reasoning, knowledge, mathematics, and coding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) available via API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is available via API through 6 providers."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I use Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Claude Fable 5.1 (Max, Default Fallback) is available through 6 API providers."}}]}58:["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$6e"}}]
